      "content": "You should absolutely differentiate the UX flow based on perceived technological comfort and cultural expectations. For Kenji, a dense, information-rich flow that emphasizes detailed data validation will likely be seen as sophisticated and trustworthy. Conversely, for Amara or Fatima, a highly simplified, gamified, or narrative-driven onboarding will reduce intimidation and feel more welcoming. Treating the baseline as a Western standard risks alienating users who expect a different level of complexity or simplicity based on their background.",
